 \nNotes: 36th annual meeting\, April 26-30\, 2027 at the Melia Sevilla\, 
 as the home and 2027 pages state: a cerebellar satellite and welcome rece
 ption on Monday April 26 (also misdated April 24)\, then the annual confe
 rence April 27-30. Calls opened October 29\, 2026 (day only)\; the portal
  is login-gated and was not checked. Submitters must be NCM members in go
 od standing\; one oral talk per member a year. Orals (individual or team 
 session) close December 1 and posters February 22 at midnight PST\, read 
 as 23:59 PST. Oral decisions January 11 per key dates\, end of January pe
 r the submission page. Abstracts are not archival. Attendance was 291-600
  in 2022-2026. Size is an editorial estimate.
